# HomeBase environment variables
#
# Local dev doesn't need this file filled in by hand: the project is linked to
# Vercel (`vercel link`) and the database is provisioned via the Vercel
# Marketplace (Neon). Run `vercel env pull .env.local` to fetch real values.
#
# - DATABASE_URL          Pooled Postgres connection (app runtime queries)
# - DATABASE_URL_UNPOOLED Direct/non-pooled connection (drizzle-kit migrations only —
#                         the pooled connection doesn't support the session-level
#                         operations migrations need)
# - BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN Vercel Blob token for photo/document attachments (added with MAD-96)
